## Add and remove drugs (customise the drugs list)

Now you can modify the drug recogniser's behaviour if there is a particular drug which it isn't finding:

To reset the drugs dictionary

from drug_named_entity_recognition.drugs_finder import reset_drugs_data reset_drugs_data()

To add a synonym

from drug_named_entity_recognition.drugs_finder import add_custom_drug_synonym add_custom_drug_synonym("potato", "sertraline")

To add a new drug

from drug_named_entity_recognition.drugs_finder import add_custom_new_drug add_custom_new_drug("potato", {"name": "solanum tuberosum"})

To remove an existing drug

from drug_named_entity_recognition.drugs_finder import remove_drug_synonym remove_drug_synonym("sertraline")
